# Tag chips: existing tags ranked by use, or add a new one
Output "tui-04-tags.gif"
Output "raw/tui-04-tags.mp4"
Source "../tapes/_setup.tape"
Sleep 800ms
Right 15
Sleep 400ms
# open: the control opens here (compose4.py syncs the 2x2 clips on it)
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "pi"
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot "raw/tui-04-tags.png"
Sleep 1500ms
Escape
Escape
Sleep 500ms
